Hi Avery,

Your account has AI Companion turned on, but usage across Business accounts tells us most people only use meeting summaries. Three more features already included in your plan:

1. Ask AI Companion mid-meeting. Joined late? Type "catch me up" in the panel and get a private summary of what you missed.
2. Smart recording. Chapters, highlights, and a "next steps" list are generated for every cloud recording. Share the chapter, not the hour-long video.
3. Team Chat compose. Draft or rewrite a message in Team Chat with a tone you pick.

All three are on by default for your account. Try one today: https://mail.zoom.us/l/ai-companion-tips

